        <h2>Bozo Sort</h2>
        <p>
            Bozo Sort is a variant of Bogo Sort that swaps two random
            elements in the array instead of shuffling it in its entirety if it is not sorted.
            <br>
            <br>
            Bozo Sort has better average Time Complexity than
            Bogo Sort at <b>n!</b>,
            but still has a worst case of <b>&infin;</b>
            since it relies on random chance.
        </p>

